{
  "_readme": [
    "Every word of the evergreen pack, in both languages. A copy change is a re-render:",
    "edit here, run render.js, run verify.js. Never edit a PNG.",
    "",
    "Rules verify.js enforces on this file (gate 6):",
    "  - no retailer is named, anywhere, in either language",
    "  - no claim window is stated as a number of days",
    "  - no dollar figure, no percentage, no 'guarantee' / 'garanti'",
    "  - EN and FR carry identical ids, grid cells, scenes, accents and sticker plans",
    "'__REDACTED__' in a row renders as an ink bar. That is compliance, not styling:",
    "the pack never prints an amount it would have to stand behind.",
    "",
    "grid = the cell this post occupies in a 3x3 profile grid. Instagram fills the",
    "grid newest-first, so grid 1 is top-left and is therefore the LAST post published.",
    "The publish order is post 01 -> 09; the reading order on the profile is 09 -> 01."
  ],

